  "title": "Array 1.35.0: Introducing SAML, world map view and new plugins",
  "summary": "PostHog 1.35.0 introduces activity logs and a brand new way of visualizing where your users are coming from with the World Map. Additionally we now support organization-level SAML login on both Cloud and Self-Hosted instances. Plus check out your Project Homepage for a few additional goodies.",
